{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_13_level_main_13-16_end","groupId":"main_13","stageId":"main_13-16","title":"挺起胸膛","storyCode":"13-18","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_13-16_end.txt","sourceHash":"de32eb48617fcdd46e725c60124e1a081faef61a3a469bfa5b4af66040db2df8","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我的衣櫃中，專門有一個抽屜用來收藏勳章。\n我在西爾軍事學院畢業時拿到的紀念章，城防軍的服役十五年獎章，還有四年前城內的混亂平息後，市議會為我頒發的倫蒂尼姆自由獎章。\n抽屜的更深處，是家族中傳下來的那些屬於舊時代的遺存。老近衛軍的帽徽，林貢斯的一片殘磚，科西嘉一世陛下親令賞賜的金杯。\n那金杯如今已經斷成兩截，上邊的雕花也都模糊不清了，不過，我仍記得每道花紋的走向，每個浮雕人物的表情。\n那是我的父親母親、我的叔叔嬸嬸們，他們心心念念的，高盧的輝煌，不可被剝奪，也永不會暗淡的輝煌。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_offce"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……那金杯相當有分量，你應該能拿那東西賣個好價錢，高盧藝術品的行情一直不錯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕只是把那東西熔了，當金子賣，也夠你隨便挑個城市，在最好的地段買上間公寓了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是我住處的鑰匙，收好了，東西就在衣櫃裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去另外選個地方，重新開始生活吧。你可以把今年的這些事，僅僅當作偶然之間做的一場噩夢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前城防軍成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"長官，是您在那幫薩卡茲追我的時候幫了我一把，是您把我藏在城防軍的辦公室裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前城防軍成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是我該感謝您，我早就不是城防軍的成員了，也不是您的高盧同胞……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前城防軍成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您沒必要——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拿去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要是在屋子裡還看上了其他什麼東西，也通通可以拿走。那些紀念品對於我已經沒什麼意義了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在局勢重新安穩下來之前，你最好繼續躲在這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"軍事委員會已經解除了城防軍的武裝，你現在在那些薩卡茲的眼裡，和維多利亞的平民沒什麼區別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前城防軍成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我們的戰友們還在外面，他們有些，呃，不安分，我想把大家都救回來……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們都被捕了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前城防軍成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我親手把他們抓起來交給了軍事委員會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前城防軍成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他眼中的憤怒還未達到頂點便早早地洩了氣。\n一如我過去對他的評價，一個懦夫，也許他作戰時有那麼一點膽量，但終究還是個懦夫。\n他在這裡與我苟且偷生，他永遠比不上那些反抗薩卡茲的戰士們。\n永遠也比不上。\n……\n我比得上嗎？\n哈哈。\n我……不在乎。\n我早就不在乎了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"前城防軍成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_399_1","isRemote":false,"text":"長官，您接下來……要去哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"血魔大君已經等了我很久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"待在這，等一切結束之後再離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想活下去，就最好祈禱到時候推開門，外面歡呼的人是維多利亞人而不是魔族佬。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"……\n歡呼的維多利亞人……\n我第一時間想到的竟然還是維多利亞會勝利。\n不，也許只是慣性使然。我當然希望特雷西斯會贏，這才是他承諾重建高盧的前提。\n我一切的犧牲，我一切的背叛，我一切再也無法被饒恕的罪孽，都是為了高盧。\n是啊，我是為了……高盧。\n但願如此。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g1_lentiavenue"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"成群的人被薩卡茲的軍隊押送著，走向遠處的城牆。\n薩卡茲想把倫蒂尼姆加固成他們的堡壘，恐怕最終的決戰就在眼前。\n他們打算固守這座維多利亞的首都？也許吧。\n隊伍裡有些人對我投來憤恨的目光，我認識他們，我們曾經……把酒言歡。\n沒有人阻攔我，薩卡茲並不在乎我去往何處。\n被豢養的羽獸，就算打開籠門，它又能飛去哪？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_mini02_victoria_street_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"勒內·萊托？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒想到能這樣和你接觸。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許這是個好的信號，至少你還沒被薩卡茲處死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有時間聊聊嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我認出你了……你是，自救軍的那個小領袖克洛維希婭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自救軍的據點都已經被我們清剿乾淨，剩下的人也應該全部撤出了倫蒂尼姆，你為什麼還在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多虧了城防軍的手下留情，也多虧了開斯特的信守承諾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她的“灰禮帽”們確實保證了自救軍順利撤出這座將死的城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"開斯特公爵……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我早就對你的身份有所猜測，不過現在，不論你是哪位閣下的附庸或傀儡，我都不關心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道你的本事到底有多大，但現在的倫蒂尼姆不適合一個造反的孩子到處遊蕩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回你之前躲著的地方吧，趁還沒被薩卡茲們逮到，我可以當作沒看見你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……萊托。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你躲在倫蒂尼姆已經夠久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和自救軍失散以後，盡可能快地在倫蒂尼姆內重新找到了行動的目標。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們也……遭到了背叛。我甚至還不清楚叛徒具體有哪些人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是我沒有時間想這些，城內的情況遠遠超過了我們對“佔領移動城市”的理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在發生的事，你在歷史書上，找不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我比誰都清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可你看過城外的情況嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到薩卡茲的法陣，紅光沖天而起，我看到形態各異的戰爭裝置，絕非尋常國家的制式裝備可比。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到巫師懸浮於半空，主宰領空，使得所有形式的無人機與源石技藝統統失效。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本以為那些描述薩卡茲軍隊和那個所謂的“食腐者”的傳說，多少都是些加油添醋來徒增恐怖色彩的文學手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不再這麼想了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當死亡本身敞開大門，我們要面臨什麼樣的人間地獄？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"公爵們呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……公爵的軍隊。堅強，宏偉，但是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們在地平線的那頭。他們遙不可及。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我猜測，你此時此刻，是不是心中懷著歉疚與悲哀，但又夾雜著一點點自豪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得，你做了許多殘忍的選擇，但是現在，你的使命完成了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我猜測，你向特雷西斯提出了一個交易，而特雷西斯答應了，有關那些曾經屬於高盧的移動城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倫蒂尼姆太小，裝不下薩卡茲的野心，他不過藉著這裡撩撥泰拉諸國蠢蠢欲動的心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的覺得他在乎你和你的高盧嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今的倫蒂尼姆已經徹底淪陷，但你不是蠢貨，你看得出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡茲戴爾軍事委員會根本沒有佔領維多利亞的計劃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不傻。我從一開始，就沒有把希望寄託在特雷西斯的承諾上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你還是參與了那麼多手足相殘的悲劇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是想創造機會？就像薩卡茲們正在為卡茲戴爾做的事情一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許，這場將所有公爵精力耗盡的戰爭，將成為高盧的幽靈再度返回人間的契機。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但問題在於——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——你真的相信嗎，勒內·萊托？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還能相信什麼呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經承認我的懦弱了，你還需要我承認我的愚蠢，我的絕望，我的毫無意義？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想找我幹嘛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"合作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自救軍，那些反抗薩卡茲，在維多利亞可笑的貴族之間掙扎求生的人，都還有一線生機。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你所奢求的所謂的“高盧”，可能也存在於那一線生機之中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……高盧啊，高盧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來，你是一位仍舊願意抗爭的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對你們這樣的人而言，就算是塵埃裡的廢墟，也能成為下一座壁壘的基石。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們都是這樣的人，你，軍事委員會……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們如此強大，強大到能顛覆國家，操弄歷史，更遑論……一兩個我這樣的人的命運。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停止你的自怨自艾吧，在地獄降臨之前，我們還有很多可以做的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論你當作贖罪還是另一次抗爭的開始，我都無所謂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊托，我希望我們能——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，了不起的人啊，你能告訴我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我該如何拯救自己嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看吧，你也沒有主意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓開吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的不打算回頭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……那麼我也不會祝福你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你背負著那麼多人的死，我的同僚們的死，你卻做出了令人不齒的決定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛維希婭","speakerId":"avg_npc_401_1","isRemote":false,"text":"勒內·萊托！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夠了。快逃吧，薩卡茲就要來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還得……去告別呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g11_victoriaroom_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"這林貢斯浸透我們的眼淚♪\n戰場充滿了苦與累♪\n但那一天總會來到♪\n要判處侵略者死罪♪\n要判處侵略者死罪♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一個住在城裡的“老近衛軍”。\n我怎麼在這個時刻最先想起他呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……你，的番，號！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您頂在我腰間的木棍依然如此有力，長官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"閉，嘴！報……出你的番號！士兵！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"林貢斯青年近衛軍第二近衛騰躍兵團，萊托下士！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顢頇的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"我的，部隊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，您的部隊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顢頇的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒，見過你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您見過，您只是忘了，長官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顢頇的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顢頇的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"皇帝陛下，命，令我在這裡養傷，但我，還是想知道，前線，的，戰況。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顢頇的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"邪惡，的巫王被我們的艦隊，摧毀了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顢頇的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"我在電視裡，看，到了維多利亞的大，大，大鬍子公爵的軍隊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顢頇的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"他，們也想趁機忤逆，皇帝陛下嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"長官，倫蒂尼姆已經陷落了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顢頇的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顢頇的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_081","isRemote":false,"text":"我會被擢為……老，近衛軍！你，還不到，時候！你，還需證明，自己！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他已經快九十歲了。他早就已經糊塗到幾乎忘記了一切。\n幾十年來，他的記憶依舊停留在高盧人追隨科西嘉一世出征萊塔尼亞的黃金盛世。\n護士總是說他會在明年去世，但他還是挺到了如今。\n挺到了高盧都已成了歷史。\n挺到了倫蒂尼姆都已經將要走進墳墓。\n……\n我在離開城防軍的崗位前，下達的最後一項命令，是保證這座療養院的安全。\n這是我在漫長的城防軍服役期間，為我自己做的唯一一件事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我給您帶了林貢斯產的蘭斯香檳，您的最愛。請坐下吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顢頇的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顢頇的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"酒很好，下士，唔……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顢頇的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這林貢斯浸透我們的眼淚♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顢頇的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"戰場充滿了苦與累♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顢頇的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……要判處侵略者死罪……♪"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您在唱這首歌的時候，就好像所有的病痛和衰老都不曾存在一般。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顢頇的老人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……我們的旗幟永遠輝煌♪"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我從未見過林貢斯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您曾和我無數次說起那些華偉的殿堂，那些發達的路網……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……您還記得戈爾丁嗎，那個很多年前，曾經和我一起來拜訪您的女孩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她為這個殘酷的，無法撼動的，沾滿了鮮血的時代而死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我，是造就這一切的兇手之一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我對她……我不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但她已經離去了。她不在我的視野裡，她不再看向我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……很害怕，先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有個叫阿米婭的孩子告訴我，我的所作所為都是因為懦弱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾向戈爾丁自白，我只是想在接踵而至的毀滅中活下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我仍然希望……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕只是藉口，我也仍然希望——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那片廢墟中會有新的高盧人站起來……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望戈爾丁能繼續教那些孩子，在陽光，和花香裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她的堅持真的很美。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我，可我卻是那個……我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經做了我能做的一切。這很累，先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您覺得我們還有未來嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"……\n……\n原來他早就睡著了。\n也好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我抽出我的佩劍。曾屬於高盧人的劍。\n我想……也許讓他在薩卡茲闖入這裡以前，停留在夢裡會更好。\n那起碼會是一個燦爛的夢。\n……可我這樣卑劣的人，豈敢伸手玷污——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"……\n已經老去的青年近衛軍的血，濺滿了我的雙手。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_victoria"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"統御鮮血的君主，血魔大君，他正靜靜望著維多利亞宮廷中華貴的裝飾。\n他臉上的表情，甚至稱得上……恬靜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你來了，萊托。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還以為你會找個地方躲起來呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，當然不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會來找您的，大君。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你今天打扮得很有精神，很好。自從你認識的那個高盧老師死後，你一直都是副垂頭喪氣的樣子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我和我的孩子們打過賭，他們猜你就快死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我是相信你的，萊托。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陪我喝一杯吧，慶祝你的仇敵，這個叫維多利亞的國家的死亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會親手開啟儀式，贈予它最古老的詛咒，最悲哀的終局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很快就要出發了。連我的族裔們都無此殊榮，你真該慶幸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大君，您知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我出生的時候，高盧的首都就已經被威靈頓公爵和他卑劣的同謀徹底毀滅了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一座城市毀滅了，如同一聲嘆息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今，您似乎要對倫蒂尼姆，做同樣的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這令你唏噓？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是……沒有想到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"威靈頓公爵拆毀了林貢斯，瓜分了那些移動地塊。呵，可笑又無趣的維多利亞人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想親手了結你的血仇嗎？我讚許你的執著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我確實可以賜你這樣的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"向您致謝，大君。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我深深地低下頭顱。但我能感覺到他的視線停留在我的身上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊……多可悲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卑鄙，善變，懦弱，自以為是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"會因為恐懼祈求憐憫，又因為絕望而自取滅亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我還是很好奇，你啊，你啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在你渺小的生命中，我們相處的時間已經不短了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——你真的以為你能殺我，萊托？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不會的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我自己的血，攥住了我自己的心臟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也許會想，這個薩卡茲是何等傲慢，對自己何等蔑視。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恰恰相反……萊托。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為我即將看見的事物，我對你，充滿，憐愛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的確愚蠢，卑劣，你該珍惜你的血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本以為，它們能有些更有趣的用途。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我們之間，倉皇的告別。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"高盧人的劍……我竭盡全力摸索著。\n卑劣者的劍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可憐的人。再努力些，再掙扎些，你就快碰到劍柄了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……賜予……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"血魔大君","speakerId":"avg_npc_410_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"劍刃劃過我的脖子，冰涼，冷冽。\n我看見我骯髒的血從頸間噴湧而出。\n這些腥紅的液體沾濕了他的衣裳，濺上了他的臉。\n哈。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說，我“賜予”你我的血，臭蛭蟲！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你再也沒法誇耀你純淨的血液了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊托中校","speakerId":"avg_npc_649_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為卑鄙的勒內·萊托污染了它！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
